OL,3,GNEWSAPair sentenced for human
OL,4,Atrafficking crimes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and woman have been sentenced for
OL,7,Fa series of offences including human
OL,8,Ftrafficking.
OL,10,FGerald Corrigan, 66, of Keeragh Park,
OL,11,FPomeroy, previously pleaded guilty to
OL,12,Fhuman trafficking, possessing criminal
OL,13,Fproperty and transferring criminal
OL,14,Fproperty. He was sentenced to 16
OL,15,Fmonths; this was broken down as eight
OL,16,Fmonths in custody and eight months on
OL,17,Flicense.
