OL,3,GNEWSAPair sentenced for human
OL,4,Atrafficking crimes
OL,5,
OL,6,FMavie Martins Mariano 51, of Ard Aveen
OL,7,FPark, Bessbrook, previously pleaded
OL,8,Fguilty to human trafficking, acquiring
OL,9,Fcriminal property, possessing criminal
OL,10,Fproperty, transferring criminal
OL,11,Fproperty, brothel keeping and
OL,12,Fcontrolling prostitution.
OL,14,FMariano, who is originally from Brazil,
OL,15,Fwas given a three year sentence.
